pdate dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.10.0 ([#1241](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1241)) ([215a11c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/215a11cc2ab375e9bfd74d331e6cdafa6824fc7c))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1235](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1235)) ([8b48866](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8b4886623c69eba8bfc532b0c69192a42ef4177b))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo to 18.10.1 ([#1242](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1242)) ([94d84f5](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/94d84f519b237e91493ea26167b0ace0c85d5256))\n* **test:** update xunit-dotnet monorepo ([#1244](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1244)) ([a1123f0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/a1123f0f39933d9535efec8eb161acdf6c1ca638))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.17 ([#1243](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1243)) ([5be0a30](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5be0a306563258c71e96773de5e52f2a0c4921ea))\n'",
